    <title>052 从&quot;在害怕孤独中等死&quot;到&quot;夕阳红创业指南&quot;：这届年轻人连养老都卷！|脑洞大开</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/688cbbd58e06fe8de7d85bbf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">688cbbd58e06fe8de7d85bbf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Aug 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>👵🏻本期声音🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播@kaiz @我睡觉的时候不困_</span></p><span></span><p><span>👵🏻时间轴⏳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 凯子和希希想象中的老年生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>——孤独、失去尊严、生活中没有盼头、对社会没有贡献……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 身边人都死光了我还活个什么劲儿啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 我们想要成为一个什么样的老人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 一个不讨人厌的老人标志：不吐苦水、不忆苦思甜、不把自己的意志强加在别人身上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 退休后到失去自理能力之前，这小二十年我们可以……？①培养一个可持续的朋友圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> ②上老年大学，不要躺平，给自己找事做，被这个世界需要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> ③把自己的人生结束在一个loose end</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> ④创业项目1——陪年轻人进博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> ⑤创业项目2——夕阳红娘，身处吃瓜第一线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> ⑤创业项目3——做老年人视频号，测评养老院，测评陪诊服务，测评轮椅，科普老年病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 为老年生活做资金准备</span></p><span></span><p><span>👵🏻相关单集🔗</span></p><span></span><p><span>025 想一出是一出的三分钟热度帮我们打开世界的维度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65233cc836a1383a66134ed2" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65233cc836a1383a66134ed2">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>014 生活索然无味蛤蟆评价人类我最近在练习心眼子别惹我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6412723ad94bb094db9f1a3a" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6412723ad94bb094db9f1a3a">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
