    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🪷 本期声音🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播@kaiz @我睡觉的时候不困_</span></p><span></span><p><span>🪷本期读书📚</span></p><span></span><p><span>《正见》，宗萨蒋扬钦哲仁波切 著，姚仁喜 译</span></p><span></span><p><span>🪷时间轴⏳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 作者简介，以及作者名字是什么意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 凯子为什么开始对佛法感兴趣了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 什么人算是佛教徒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 好了，开始吧，定理一：一切和合事物皆无常，接受且无畏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 希希最难理解的部分来了，定理二：一切情绪皆苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 定理三：到底什么是“四大皆空”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 定理四：来吧，立地成佛吧，你已经准备好“涅槃”了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a> 佛教不是一种信仰，而是真理的传播</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> 听到最后有惊喜！</span></p><span></span><p><span>相关单集</span></p><span></span><p><span>035 手动更改自己的mbti逐渐P化放过自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65ea68032d96b6aa80757d0c" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65ea68032d96b6aa80757d0c">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>011 凯子要和自己的情绪管理问题斗争到底</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63758993b0725ebdf1e702b3" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63758993b0725ebdf1e702b3">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
