    <guid isPermaLink="false">677de6ebcda04ef4c12ee88e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Jan 2025 02:58:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>宁宁开门听友群开始组建啦！！进群方式：搜索添加小助手好友：</span><strong><span>Slept_n_Komorebi</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小助手会把大家拉进群里（wink~）</span></p><span></span><p><span>💞本期主播🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><span>@kaiz @我睡觉的时候不困_</span></p><span></span><p><span>💞本期主题🧶</span></p><span></span><p><span>凯子和希希最近看芒果台《再见爱人》有点上头，观察室里的嘉宾都说的太委婉了，还是要自己开麦！直抒胸臆！从每对嘉宾的身上，我们都或多或少地看到了自己的影子或者自己的关系的某些方面，如果我们说的不对，那一定是我们说错了，更多的还是凯子和希希自己的理解，不一定客观，不保证正确。</span></p><span></span><p><span>💞时间戳⌛️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> 希希最能共情李行亮，同时觉得和黄圣依同为淡人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 麦、李的“大和解”把希希创飞，但是凯子觉得很合理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 李行亮在夫妻关系里遭受“霸凌”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> 麦琳需不需要找个班上？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 凯子送给麦琳同时也送给自己的十二个字“心内求法、两头放下、训练发心、本自具足”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a> 在希希看来李行亮是个溺水的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 一个真理分享给大家“一块萝卜搭一块糕”“一个猴一个栓法儿”🐒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 凯子的“硬币理论”🪙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2350">39:10</a> 有的时候麦琳是大家的“嘴替”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">46:45</a> 葛夕和留几手是很可爱的一对</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 留几手是个死小孩，而且非真正的“异性恋”（请听希希详解！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 请观察室给观察嘉宾们准备一个小黑屋来进行合理发泄情绪😤</span></p><span></span><p><span>💞相关单集</span></p><span></span><p><span>038 从“菀菀类卿”聊到“没头脑和不高兴”<a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6656c861790e136fcb735d55" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6656c861790e136fcb735d55">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>024 喜欢一个人该怎么撩<a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/650d7bd69687557971fe8e79" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/650d7bd69687557971fe8e79">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>041 焦虑型依恋和回避型依恋的相爱相杀<a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66c6114c33591c27becb0ca4" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66c6114c33591c27becb0ca4">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
