    <guid isPermaLink="false">672332ebcbe0e69c8b0eeb9a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Nov 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>♟️ 本期声音🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播@kaiz @我睡觉的时候不困_</span></p><span></span><p><span>宁宁开门听友群开始组建啦！！进群方式：搜索添加小助手好友：</span><strong><span>Slept_n_Komorebi</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小助手会把大家拉进群里（wink~）</span></p><span></span><p><span>♟️本期读书📚</span></p><span></span><p><span>《象棋的故事》，【奥】斯蒂芬·茨威格</span></p><span></span><p><span>♟️宁宁开门小喇叭~</span></p><span></span><p><span>七幕年度巨献——《我，堂吉诃德》封箱轮</span></p><span></span><p><span>20世纪殿堂级音乐剧</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾在全球40多个国家和地区演出</span></p><span></span><p><span>场场震撼，一票难求</span></p><span></span><p><span>#音乐剧《我，堂吉诃德》中文版十周年封箱</span></p><span></span><p><span>🗓9月13日-11月17日</span></p><span></span><p><span>📍北京·上海·深圳·广州</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq-d-ylvcBvu-C_b7C3yhdcRTi8i.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>♟️时间轴⏳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 作者简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 创作背景——茨威格自杀前的最后一部作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 故事开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 世界象棋冠军岑托维奇的童年经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 岔出去讲一下巴兰的驴子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 岑托维奇初现象棋天赋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 岑托维奇靠下棋疯狂捞钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 全美巡回赛结束后，在去往阿根廷的船上，土木工程师麦克希望向岑托维奇发起挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 车轮对弈开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 神秘人出手相助，众人和世界冠军打成和局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> 神秘人——出生名门世家的B博士，曾主理一家律师事务所，为神职人员和皇室提供法律咨询和资产管理服务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> B博士在被囚禁的过程中意外获得救命稻草</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> B博士无处宣泄自己的躁狂和愤怒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> B博士决定和岑托维奇下一盘棋，就一盘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> 哦不，再来一盘吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>♟️相关单集🎧</span></p><span></span><p><span>040 在额尔古纳河右岸我们看见山峰看见河流看见晚霞也学会告别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/667adee2f0be21275340d395" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/667adee2f0be21275340d395">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>033 宁宁读书之《长安的荔枝》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/658048d620d779b49d9deda4" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/658048d620d779b49d9deda4">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>021 世界名著果然不是每个人都能读的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/649952ebd6cdb597286404f1" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/649952ebd6cdb597286404f1">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
